      "key": "dxf-viewer.example",
      "source": "A line from (0, 0) to (10, 0) measures 10 drawing units. The viewer reads the DXF unit code when present; when it is absent, measurements are labelled as drawing units.",
      "source_hash": "ce884c6216576feda9fdd1b0a2604b98788c5f8f014b2f391314b12b8951afe3",
      "context": "example",
      "translation": "从 (0, 0) 到 (10, 0) 的线段长度为 10 个绘图单位。查看器会读取 DXF 文件中声明的单位代码；如果未声明，测量结果会标为绘图单位。",
      "old_record_id": "9e16c4855f2008e41c3b49f99f553b54bcc6e8fa6c8001c588e6350033bde396",
      "old_translation_hash": "480499e9ebbba8d2f13317fa7a646e3d02b522be9811969ecf9d386b151195da",
      "kind": "style-correction",
