    {
      "key": "shikaku.details",
      "source": "Choose a start square, then choose an end square to draw a rectangle. You can also drag across the grid. Every rectangle must contain one clue whose number matches its area.",
      "source_hash": "2faf9d87998fbccd93e0a34a26735ea2d111b6127af2981fc4ef0dc8705dbba4",
      "context": "details",
      "translation": "选择一个开始方格,然后选择一个结束方格来画一个矩形。 您也可以在网格上拖移。 每个矩形必须包含一个数字线索。 这个数字必须等于矩形内的正方形数。",
      "old_record_id": "f6d48ca27ef1dea06173b0d9e9d2ed5c11be24f3381cc662270cbf7d89567898",
      "old_translation_hash": "d9900013009990d2007cc074af09571cf27035e91deef83df83e9361edb07466",
      "kind": "proved-current-variant",
      "native_review": false,
      "review_kind": "agent",
      "old_policy": "context-v25"
    },
    {
      "key": "shikaku.intro",
      "source": "Draw rectangles so every number is the area of exactly one region. Cover every square once, with no overlaps.",
      "source_hash": "6b55fa1e3b28bc596a9ea90e686bce05cb108ac91729eff5a4bb55aaf4ecc058",
      "context": "intro",
      "translation": "绘制矩形,使每个数字都是正好一个区域的面积。 覆盖每个方格一次,不要重叠。",
      "old_record_id": "70deef0ba12c3c39b8625e39bf324f2506199ecd9a28288bc891f2f7e85572db",
      "old_translation_hash": "16b69b994c022f1fd4c6f8ab61320b8fafd0ccacbcca91dc5fc6d897ef1c6f3b",
      "kind": "proved-current-variant",
      "native_review": false,
      "review_kind": "agent",
      "old_policy": "context-v25"
    },
    {
      "key": "voice-changer.faq.2.a",
      "source": "No. It applies simple audio effects. It does not clone a person, isolate vocals, or turn a voice into another real person.",
      "source_hash": "809eaffb0f717879b5b5041d5d9bb7340dfbd8d1e77a5eed2a135d8fba01bcdf",
      "context": "faq.2.a",
      "translation": "该工具无法克隆人或隔离语音轨道。 它无法让声音听起来像另一个真实的人。 它只添加简单的音频效果。",
      "old_record_id": "a562479f00f7f282f3cf4b1db1cb33313a1dd0e8929cfe443f34f846f4194f4c",
      "old_translation_hash": "1c04f1dc77bda4a08e37154745644ca9d44239abad5b894e88d63633c86ccd98",
      "kind": "proved-current-variant",
      "native_review": false,
      "review_kind": "agent",
      "old_policy": "context-v25"
    },
    {
      "key": "voice-changer.faq.3.a",
      "source": "The tool renders a standard uncompressed WAV file in your browser. The input may be any audio format that your browser can decode.",
      "source_hash": "36140ce8462a25b57c9ba69b2cb20061e69ad445824bcd9d735b018b7bfe1c1e",
      "context": "faq.3.a",
      "translation": "此工具在您的浏览器中创建一个标准的未压缩的WAV文件。 您可以使用您的浏览器可以解码的任何输入音频格式。",
      "old_record_id": "da25465993b15e769e92e3f17ab36aa34c429aecdc24b407eebbe986647e627a",
      "old_translation_hash": "2c01f1ca6e8c2383e0b60673a1eeb4f7b7c9ba81de3e871a6a03d6dd91e0ee00",
      "kind": "proved-current-variant",
      "native_review": false,
      "review_kind": "agent",
      "old_policy": "context-v25"
    },
    {
      "key": "voice-changer.fields.faq3a",
      "source": "No. It applies simple audio effects. It does not clone a person, isolate vocals, or turn a voice into another real person.",
      "source_hash": "809eaffb0f717879b5b5041d5d9bb7340dfbd8d1e77a5eed2a135d8fba01bcdf",
      "context": "fields.faq3a",
      "translation": "该工具无法克隆人或隔离语音轨道。 它无法让声音听起来像另一个真实的人。 它只添加简单的音频效果。",
      "old_record_id": "20ac9b270b944522a8d3df6d243831567a7ab4fd964ca1046e9ceab9df6eb0ec",
