    {
      "key": "voice-changer.intro",
      "source": "Give a short audio clip a lower, higher, radio, bright, or echo effect. Preview the result, adjust it, and export a WAV file on your device.",
      "source_hash": "848926741c46009849a7e27867a28fdba48a4e2b3dcfe0df97682c25c0dcb469",
      "context": "intro",
      "translation": "让短音频片段的音高变低或变高，或添加收音机、明亮音色或回声效果。试听并调整结果，然后在此设备上导出 WAV 文件。",
      "old_record_id": "b72d9292510506fa813f0ea3f8a2cbbb3d61fe47b3698c0be8923a5024a4fb97",
